  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Unit test stability pt 2 by @batesyuk in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/517\r\n* Updated version -> 1.0.6 by @batesyuk in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/519\r\n* GOVUKAPP-2453 Chat card by @raphaelolu in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/509\r\n* GOVUKAPP-2098  Non tappable card by @raphaelolu in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/520\r\n* govukapp 2496: chat animation changes by @joshdubey in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/521\r\n* [GOVUKAPP-2483 & GOVUKAPP-2265] Update chat assets by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/523\r\n* Handle chat token refresh when biometrics not enrolled by @joshdubey in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/522\r\n* govukapp-2529:  chat opt in analytics by @joshdubey in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/524\r\n* GOVUKAPP-2531 Popular pages duplication bug  by @TimGJD in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/525\r\n* govukapp-2547: Conditionally show chat accuracy warning by @joshdubey in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/526\r\n* govukapp-2455: Use remote config chat flags by @joshdubey in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/527\r\n* govvukapp-2048:  Chat copy to clipboard by @joshdubey in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/529\r\n* Added error logs for login by @batesyuk in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/528\r\n* Turn off chat by @batesyuk in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/533\r\n* Fix return user missing issue. by @batesyuk in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/553\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-mobile-ios-app/compare/1.0.5...1.0.6",
